# Armadillo bundled known-malware hash list (starter seed).
#
# Format: one entry per line. Each line may be:
#   - a bare hex digest (MD5=32, SHA-1=40, SHA-256=64 hex chars), or
#   - ClamAV hash-signature form  `hash:size:name`, or
#   - a CSV row whose first field is the hash (MalwareBazaar export).
# Lines beginning with `#` are comments.
#
# Real coverage is meant to come from `armadillo update` (abuse.ch / URLhaus
# open exports). This seed exists so the hash engine works offline on day one
# and so the EICAR self-test is caught by the hash path as well as YARA.

